<title>USA: Hertz IPO slated for end of April - underwriter.</title>
<headline>Hertz IPO slated for end of April - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of Hertz Corp is scheduled to price towards the end of April, according to lead underwriter J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p>Ford Motor Co, the parent of Hertz, said at the end of February it planned to sell less than 20 percent of its car rental unit in an initial public offering.</p>
<p>The number of shares or the estimated pricing range for the offering have not been determined yet, the underwriter said.</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
